  "files": {},
  "metadata": {
    "title": "FlashAttention avoids full matrices in HBM",
    "description": "FlashAttention tiles attention blocks in on-chip SRAM and uses online softmax, avoiding storage of full n-by-n score and probability matrices in HBM. The output is exact and memory traffic drops, while FLOPs remain O(n\u00b2d)."
  }
